OL,3,GNEWSAFirst-time buyer wary of Budget
OL,4,Ahousing loan scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Luke Anstee, buying a first home
OL,7,Fwould mean more than getting on the
OL,8,Fproperty ladder.
OL,10,FThe 23-year-old hopes it would give him
OL,11,Fthe chance to put down roots after
OL,12,Fspending much of his childhood moving
OL,13,Faround because of his father's Army
OL,14,Fcareer.
OL,16,FFurther details of the government's
OL,17,Fproposed Your First Home scheme are
OL,18,Fexpected in Wednesday's Budget, with
OL,19,Fministers saying it could help
OL,20,Ffirst-time buyers purchase a property
OL,21,Fwith a deposit as low as 2.5%.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
